duction in our U.S. facilities.</p><p>Praxera is a division of FoodScience Corp, an FDA-registered food facility, GMP certified to SQF food safety standards, and certified to NSF GMP 455-2.</p><p>When you partner with us, our expert team is with you every step of the way. Help your customers find what they want from a source they trust. You.</p>", "css_class": "dnd-module", "eyebrow": "50+ YEARS OF PROVIDING TOP-QUALITY SUPPLEMENTS", "headline": "Developed by us. Made for you.", "headline_size": 32, "images": [], "max_width": 900, "module_id": 218954101913, "style": {"background_color": {"color": "#E6E5E3", "opacity": 100}, "padding": {"padding_bottom": 80, "padding_top": 80}}, "text_color": "dark"}, "rowMetaData": [], "rows": [], "type": "module", "w": 0, "x": 0}}], "type": "cell", "w": 0, "x": 0}}, {"0": {"cells": [], "cssClass": "", "cssId": "", "cssStyle": "", "name": "column_9", "params": {"css_class": "dnd-column"}, "rowMetaData": [{"cssClass": "dnd-row"}], "rows": [{"0": {"cells": [], "cssClass": "", "cssId": "", "cssStyle": "", "label": "module_9", "name": "module_9", "params": {"answer_size": 15, "css_class": "dnd-module", "headline_lh": "normal", "headline_size": 32, "items": [{"answer": "The Definitive Guide to Private Label Supplements. It covers what private label is, what it costs, how to choose categories, FDA basics, and how to think about a launch plan. Most clients read it before their first consultation.", "question": "What's the most useful resource if I'm just exploring private label?"}, {"answer": "No. All our resources are free. We share them because educated clients make better decisions and better partners. If you find the guides useful, that's a good sign we'd be a fit to work together.", "question": "Do you charge for these guides?"}, {"answer": "We add new guides and case studies as the industry evolves. Major guides are refreshed annually. Subscribe to updates during your consultation to be notified when new resources publish.", "question": "How often do you publish new resources?"}, {"answer": "Yes. Feel free to share any of our resources internally or with partners. We ask you not to repost them publicly on your own site without attribution, but sharing within your business or with vendors is totally fine.", "question": "Can I share these guides with my team or partners?"}, {"answer": "We share aggregated insights from our private label client base when patterns emerge that brand builders should know. We don't publish proprietary client data. Industry data on the broader supplement market is best sourced from NPD, SPINS, or the Council for Responsible Nutrition.", "question": "Do you publish industry data or market research?"}], "max_width": 820, "module_id": 218940115739, "open_first": false, "question_size": 17, "section_eyebrow": "", "section_headline": "Frequently asked questions", "section_subhead": "", "style": {"background_color": {"color": "#F7F7F6", "opacity": 100}, "padding": {"padding_bottom": 80, "padding_top": 80}}, "text_color": "dark"}, "rowMetaData": [], "rows": [], "type": "module", "w": 0, "x": 0}}], "type": "cell", "w": 0, "x": 0}}, {"0": {"cells": [], "cssClass": "", "cssId": "", "cssStyle": "", "name": "column_10", "params": {"css_class": "dnd-column"}, "rowMetaData": [{"cssClass": "dnd-row"}], "rows": [{"0": {"cells": [], "cssClass": "", "cssId": "", "cssStyle": "", "label": "module_10", "name": "module_10", "params": {"css_class": "dnd-module", "module_id": 218942529652}, "rowMetaData": [], "rows": [], "type": "module", "w": 0, "x": 0}}], "type": "cell", "w": 0, "x": 0}}], "type": "cell", "w": 0, "x": 0}}